        "original_id": "121976c6-4f8b-5e4b-8314-9c1e7ace7050",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Florida State Road 922, Haulover Park, Baker's Haulover Inlet, Bal Harbour Shops\n- Organizations: Whitman family\n- Topics: commercial corridors, family-owned malls, recreation, nude beaches, marinas\n\nFacts:\n- Florida State Road 922 is an important commercial artery in northeastern Miami-Dade County, and stores line much of its route.\n- Bal Harbour Shops is located near the eastern terminus of Florida State Road 922.\n- Haulover Park is located on a shoal between the Atlantic Ocean and Biscayne Bay, just north of Broad Causeway (SR 922) and Collins Avenue.\n- Baker's Haulover Inlet is the location of Haulover Park's official nude beach, recreation areas, and marina within the park's 99 acres.\n- Bal Harbour Shops is owned by the Whitman family and is one of the few remaining family-owned malls in the United States.",
